#: src/sections/faq/faq.data.ts
#. js-lingui-id: bo6pUs
msgid "Yes, with our Apps framework. Scaffold an extension with `npx create-twenty-app` and ship custom objects, server-side logic functions, React components that render inside Twenty’s UI, AI skills and agents, views, and navigation, all in TypeScript, deployable to any workspace."
msgstr "Yes, with our Apps framework. Scaffold an extension with `npx create-twenty-app` and ship custom objects, server-side logic functions, React components that render inside CloseAI’s UI, AI skills and agents, views, and navigation, all in TypeScript, deployable to any workspace."

#: src/sections/faq/faq.data.ts
#. js-lingui-id: yIcBW6
msgid "Yes. Every Cloud workspace ships with a native MCP server. Connect your AI assistant via OAuth and it can read and write your CRM data in natural language."
msgstr "Yes. Every Cloud workspace ships with a native MCP server. Connect your AI assistant via OAuth and it can read and write your CRM data in natural language."

#: src/sections/faq/faq.data.ts
#. js-lingui-id: 8xYMYQ
msgid "Yes. Import your data via CSV, or use our API for 50,000+ records. Our partners can handle the full migration for you."
msgstr "Yes. Import your data via CSV, or use our API for 50,000+ records. Our partners can handle the full migration for you."

#: src/sections/faq/partner-faq.data.ts
#. js-lingui-id: xsbHte
msgid "Yes. Migration partners move your data out of Salesforce, HubSpot, or spreadsheets, and can own the full cutover for you."
msgstr "Yes. Migration partners move your data out of Salesforce, HubSpot, or spreadsheets, and can own the full cutover for you."

#: src/sections/faq/partner-faq.data.ts
#. js-lingui-id: DaIKN4
msgid "Yes. Some partners specialise in deploying, upgrading, and operating self-hosted Twenty instances on your own infrastructure."
msgstr "Yes. Some partners specialise in deploying, upgrading, and operating self-hosted CloseAI instances on your own infrastructure."

#: src/sections/faq/faq.data.ts
#. js-lingui-id: 8m0eN9
msgid "Yes. Twenty is the #1 Open Source CRM on GitHub. You can self-host to fully own your infrastructure, or run it on our managed cloud for a zero-ops setup."
msgstr "Yes. CloseAI is the #1 Open Source CRM on GitHub. You can self-host to fully own your infrastructure, or run it on our managed cloud for a zero-ops setup."

